# Milestone: M6 Wave 2
# Covers: Phase 5 atom-method dispatch — Boolean named methods.
#
# Symbolic operators (&&, ||, !) are not Wave-1 lex tokens; the v1.0
# named-method form is .negate() for the unary inverse.  Equality is
# the inline OP_EQ opcode (no slot lookup), so true == false routes
# without atom-method dispatch.

true.negate()
[00000000] false

false.negate()
[00000001] true

# Idempotent under double-negation.
true.negate().negate()
[00000002] true
